WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
The tentative fee for a single room is two tons per month. In addition,

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,000
Guests are prohibited from maliciously wasting electricity in the room

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
Once unusually high power consumption is detected,

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,200
The system directly cuts off the power of the room itself

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,290
Received from host boss

6
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:16,690
I can store the room for three months without any problem.

7
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,890
A total of six thousand three hundred and seventy points

8
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:20,270
Why are you ignoring it?

9
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,670
You can also feel that spending money is like running water

10
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:24,560
It's harder to dive than to reach the sky. It seems like you won't kill zombies.

11
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,960
I don't even have the qualifications to lie down here.

12
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,160
I don't plan to go out tomorrow

13
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,160
What I have collected so far is enough for the time being.

14
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,760
Thank you for your hard work these past two days

15
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,760
It's not hard work just waiting for home exchange.

16
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:40,260
Boss, I've gone back to my room. Great system.

17
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:42,660
Check the hotel's operating conditions these days
